. cd `"`root'/02_code/10_analysis"'
<PACKAGE_ROOT>/02_code/10_analysis

. do "A1_01_flow_coverage.do" corrected2x 

. /****************************************************************************
> ***
>  A1_01_flow_coverage.do  --  A1.1 sample flow, A1.2 coverage (analysis block 
> A1)
>  Usage (cwd = 02_code/10_analysis):  stata-mp -b -q do A1_01_flow_coverage.do <vi
> ntage>
>  Input : ${OUT}/prepared.dta (read only). Output: ${OUT}/tables/A1_A1.1_*.csv
> ,
>          ${OUT}/tables/A1_A1.2_*.csv, ${OUT}/results/A1_parts/A1_01.csv, logs
> .
>  Sample definitions = PREP flags (01_prep.do section F), reproduced here by t
> he same
